<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#4f46e5">
  <title>Teacher's Study Desk</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css teacher">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Teacher's Study Desk</p>
      <h1>Good day, <span id="teacherName">Teacher</span> 👋</h1>
      <p id="today"></p>
    </div>
    <button id="themeToggle" class="icon-button" title="Toggle dark mode">🌙</button>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="welcome-card">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Your daily teaching space</p>
        <h2>Plan lessons, track progress, and help every student grow.</h2>
        <p>Everything is saved in this browser and works offline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="welcome-icon">📚</div>
    </section>

    <section class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card"><span>Students today</span><strong id="studentCount">10</strong><small>Daily teaching list</small></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><span>Completed tasks</span><strong id="completedCount">0</strong><small>Keep up the great work</small></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><span>Open tasks</span><strong id="openCount">0</strong><small>Things to remember</small></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><span>Current time</span><strong id="currentTime">--:--</strong><small id="connectionStatus">Offline-ready</small></div>
    </section>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Daily students</p>
            <h2>Teaching list</h2>
          </div>
          <button id="resetStudents" class="text-button">Reset</button>
        </div>
        <p class="muted">Record whether each student practiced reading or writing.</p>
        <div id="studentList" class="student-list"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Remember something</p>
            <h2>Quick task</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form id="taskForm" class="task-form">
          <input id="taskInput" type="text" placeholder="Example: Prepare phonics cards" required>
          <div class="form-row">
            <select id="taskType">
              <option>Homework</option>
              <option>Lesson preparation</option>
              <option>Reminder</option>
            </select>
            <select id="taskPriority">
              <option>Normal priority</option>
              <option>High priority</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <button class="primary-button" type="submit">＋ Add task</button>
        </form>
        <div id="taskList" class="task-list"></div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Useful classroom helpers</p>
          <h2>Language practice tools</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tool-tabs">
        <button class="tool-tab active" data-tool="pronouns">Pronouns</button>
        <button class="tool-tab" data-tool="phonetics">Phonetics</button>
        <button class="tool-tab" data-tool="grammar">Grammar</button>
      </div>

      <div id="pronouns" class="tool-content active">
        <div class="tool-intro">
          <h3>Pronoun practice</h3>
          <p>Ask the student to replace the bold name with the correct pronoun.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="practice-box">
          <strong id="pronounQuestion">Maria is reading. ___ is reading.</strong>
          <button id="newPronoun" class="secondary-button">New question</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="phonetics" class="tool-content">
        <div class="tool-intro">
          <h3>Phonics and sounds</h3>
          <p>Choose a sound and ask the student to say words that begin with it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sound-grid" id="soundGrid">
          <button data-sound="b">B /b/</button>
          <button data-sound="m">M /m/</button>
          <button data-sound="s">S /s/</button>
          <button data-sound="t">T /t/</button>
          <button data-sound="sh">SH /ʃ/</button>
          <button data-sound="ch">CH /tʃ/</button>
        </div>
        <div id="soundResult" class="practice-box">Choose a sound to begin.</div>
      </div>

      <div id="grammar" class="tool-content">
        <div class="tool-intro">
          <h3>Parts of speech</h3>
          <p>Use these simple examples when teaching grammar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grammar-cards">
          <article><span class="badge noun">Noun</span><h3>person, place, or thing</h3><p>teacher · school · book</p></article>
          <article><span class="badge verb">Verb</span><h3>an action word</h3><p>read · write · jump</p></article>
          <article><span class="badge adjective">Adjective</span><h3>describes a noun</h3><p>kind · bright · small</p></article>
          <article><span class="badge adverb">Adverb</span><h3>describes an action</h3><p>quickly · quietly · carefully</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel notes-panel">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Teaching notes</p>
          <h2>Save a quick note</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="saved-message" id="savedMessage"></span>
      </div>
      <textarea id="notes" placeholder="Write ideas, observations, or tomorrow's lesson plan..."></textarea>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>Teacher's Study Desk · Your information stays on this device</footer>
  <script src="js script teacher"></script>
</body>
</html>
